    {
      "id": "dataflow-content",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 1580,
      "width": 980,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 132,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. USER ACTION → User calls Core.createCurve() or Core.exactInBuy()/Sell() via Frontend\n\n2. SMART CONTRACT → Core emits Buy/Sell/CreateCurve events, BondingCurve emits Sync/Lock/Listing events\n\n3. INDEXER → Polls Push Chain every 5s, parses events, writes to PostgreSQL (Token, Transaction, Holder tables)\n\n4. WORKER → Bull queue processes metrics calculation, updates volume24h, marketCap, holderCount, PriceHistory\n\n5. API → Serves data via REST + WebSocket, pushes real-time updates to Frontend, reads from Redis cache",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 12,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 132,
      "index": "b1N",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "updated": 1768800000000,
      "link": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. USER ACTION → User calls Core.createCurve() or Core.exactInBuy()/Sell() via Frontend\n\n2. SMART CONTRACT → Core emits Buy/Sell/CreateCurve events, BondingCurve emits Sync/Lock/Listing events\n\n3. INDEXER → Polls Push Chain every 5s, parses events, writes to PostgreSQL (Token, Transaction, Holder tables)\n\n4. WORKER → Bull queue processes metrics calculation, updates volume24h, marketCap, holderCount, PriceHistory\n\n5. API → Serves data via REST + WebSocket, pushes real-time updates to Frontend, reads from Redis cache",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 2
    },
