      "seed": 144,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FACTORY:\n  • getCurve(token) → curveAddress\n  • getCreator(token) → creatorAddress\n  • getConfig() → Config struct (all params)\n  • getDeployFee() / getListingFee()\n  • getCreatorFeeShare() → basis points\n\nCORE:\n  • getCurrentPrice(token) → price\n  • calculateMarketCap(token) → marketCap\n  • getCurveData(curve) → (vNative, vToken, k)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
